      "content": "acetaminophen never really works for my tooth pain though, it's way too weak. i've used advil for years and it's the only thing that touches it. if i just take it with a big meal or maybe some antacids at the same time, would that make it safe enough? i really need to get through the night and i'd rather just take the ibuprofen than deal with this toothache all night long.",
